    "# 🔧 BERT Fine-Tuning for Downstream Tasks\n",
    "\n",
    "## 🎯 Complete Guide to Fine-Tuning BERT\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook demonstrates how to fine-tune pre-trained BERT models for various downstream NLP tasks.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 📋 Tasks Covered\n",
    "1. **Sequence Classification** - Sentiment analysis, topic classification\n",
    "2. **Token Classification** - Named Entity Recognition (NER), POS tagging\n",
    "3. **Question Answering** - Extractive QA systems\n",
    "\n",
    "### 🏗️ Architecture Overview\n",
    "- **Pre-trained BERT** as the backbone\n",
    "- **Task-specific heads** for different downstream tasks\n",
    "- **Fine-tuning framework** with proper training loops\n",
    "- **Evaluation metrics** for each task type\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
