    "1. **Use the BERT implementation from our main BERT notebook**\n",
    "2. **Load a pre-trained model from Hugging Face**\n",
    "3. **Use the simplified BERT below for demonstration**\n",
    "\n",
    "For this demo, we'll create a simplified BERT structure:"
